                  "id": "Toagf",
                  "name": "logoDescT",
                  "fill": "$ink-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 500,
                  "content": "The BelegPilot mark is a bold 'B' letterform set inside a rounded teal square. The geometric simplicity communicates precision and reliability — core values for financial document processing.\n\nThe Deep Teal (#0E7C6B) evokes Swiss financial trust while remaining distinct from competitors. The rounded square shape softens the mark's authority, making it approachable yet professional.\n\nThe logo uses Plus Jakarta Sans Extra Bold for the letterform, ensuring legibility at all sizes from favicon to signage.",
