          "content": "✕  Do not stretch or distort the logo\n✕  Do not change the logo colors\n✕  Do not rotate the logo\n✕  Do not add effects (shadows, gradients, outlines)\n✕  Do not place the logo on busy backgrounds\n✕  Do not rearrange logo elements\n✕  Do not use the logo smaller than minimum size\n✕  Do not crop or partially hide the logo",
